                                                "sense_id": "ae5be3cc-6a48-358f-b97e-196379fd5a37",
                                                "text": "The securities laws are a prophylactic against stock fraud."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d34789a-bd79-4dd5-89ee-9b0f2062c1ab",
                                                "sense_id": "ae5be3cc-6a48-358f-b97e-196379fd5a37",
                                                "text": "Since tere are increasingly powerful anti-free speech tendencies in the left in general and in the Lesbian and Gay movements in particular in the form of the antiporn movement and other tendencies, I will quote extensively from the second chapter of On Liberty, \"On The Liberty Of Thought And Discussion,\" as a valuable and much needed prophylactic to these trends."
                                            }
                                        ]
